OL,3,GNEWSAPublic safety operation over
OL,4,ADrumcree as NI secretary calls for calm
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "major public safety operation" will
OL,7,Fcontinue in Portadown this weekend as
OL,8,Fthe Drumcree parade dispute continues.
OL,10,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,11,F(PSNI) said it was "continuing to seek
OL,12,Fsafe and peaceful compliance" with the
OL,13,FParades Commission's decision that the
OL,14,FOrange Order parade could go ahead with
OL,15,Frestrictions.
OL,17,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,18,FBryant also called for calm and said
OL,19,F"everyone across Northern Ireland wants
OL,20,Fa peaceful resolution".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
