OL,3,GNEWSAPublic safety operation over
OL,4,ADrumcree as NI secretary calls for calm
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, the PSNI Chief Constable
OL,7,Fsaid there would be an investigation
OL,8,Fafter protesters blocked the mainly
OL,9,Fnationalist road to prevent the parade
OL,10,Ffrom happening.
